#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:1
msgid "教程：导入有限元结果"
msgstr "Tutorial: Import finite-element results"

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:3
msgid "有限元求解器算出的磁场逐通道导入。**一个通道一个文件**，每个文件覆盖全部评估点、包含三分量，并且是规范 SI 单位。"
msgstr "Fields computed by a finite-element solver are imported per channel. **One channel per file**, with every file covering all evaluation points, carrying three components, and using canonical SI units."

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:5
msgid "每通道 CSV 格式"
msgstr "Per-channel CSV format"

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:11
msgid "`point_id` 必须与采样区域的点 ID 完全一致（顺序也要一致），`bx_T/by_T/bz_T` 是特斯拉单位的三分量。通道标识和分量坐标框架在构建定义中声明："
msgstr "`point_id` must match the sampling region's point IDs exactly (order included); `bx_T/by_T/bz_T` are the three components in tesla. Channel identity and the component coordinate frame are declared in the build definition:"

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:25
msgid "`channel_ids` 与 `channel_files` 一一对应，且顺序会被固化进 manifest。"
msgstr "`channel_ids` and `channel_files` correspond one-to-one, and their order is frozen into the manifest."

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:27
msgid "坐标容差"
msgstr "Coordinate tolerance"

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:29
msgid "`coordinate_tolerance_m` 是显式的坐标匹配容差，默认 0。有限元网格点与评估点不可能重排；如果你确实需要按坐标容差匹配，必须显式声明，且每个点只能无歧义地对应到一个评估点。重排一个文件而不重排所有依赖文件是常见错误来源。"
msgstr "`coordinate_tolerance_m` is an explicit coordinate-matching tolerance, default 0. Finite-element mesh points and evaluation points can never be reordered; if you really need tolerance-based matching, declare it explicitly and every point must map unambiguously to one evaluation point. Reordering one file without reordering every dependent file is a common source of errors."

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:31
msgid "HDF5 与 VTK 变体"
msgstr "HDF5 and VTK variants"

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:33
msgid "HDF5 字段：数据集 `point_ids`（`[N]`）和 `field_T_per_A`（`[N,3]`），根属性 `channel_id`、`coordinate_frame`、`field_unit=T/A`。"
msgstr "HDF5 fields: datasets `point_ids` (`[N]`) and `field_T_per_A` (`[N,3]`), root attributes `channel_id`, `coordinate_frame`, and `field_unit=T/A`."

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:34
msgid "VTK 族字段：点数据 `field_T_per_A`（`[N,3]`），点身份来自网格点，通道和框架在导入时声明。"
msgstr "VTK-family fields: point data `field_T_per_A` (`[N,3]`); point identity comes from the mesh points, and channel and frame are declared at import."

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:36
msgid "导出前的纪律"
msgstr "Export discipline"

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:38
msgid "在权威点集上重新导出所有通道，保持点顺序一致。"
msgstr "Re-export all channels on the authoritative point set, keeping point order identical."

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:39
msgid "非 SI 导出先在受控的预处理步骤里确定性转换，并保留原始文件与转换记录。"
msgstr "Convert non-SI exports deterministically in a controlled preprocessing step and keep the original files and conversion records."

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:40
msgid "不要平均、插值或丢弃任何通道。"
msgstr "Never average, interpolate, or drop a channel."

#: ../../tutorials/import-fe-results.md:42
msgid "完成后，在硬件和场景步骤里使用完全相同的通道标识和顺序。"
msgstr "Afterwards, use exactly the same channel identities and order in the hardware and scenario steps."
